  "description": {
    "silhouette": "Persistent base core (four 3-cell corner bastions, 3-cell entrances) and outpost shapes built per cell from the 8-neighbour mask; every cell is a flat turret emplacement with a central pad; styles burg, fort, feld, wall.",
    "colors": "Warm rustic: weathered timber, fieldstone, slate, ochre canvas; warm fire and lantern light; blue only as an accent, never violet.",
    "anatomy": "One BU is one metre / one cell / 32 display pixels. Geometry stays inside its cell; neighbours continue it across the shared cell line only.",
    "animation": "Static; fire, lanterns and windows are separate emission materials, chimneys and Kohten carry smoke sockets."
  },
